      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR HOLLYWOOD (5) finished midfield in the Roebourne Cup last start and will find this a little bit easier. His form here prior was sound and Kate Pateman hopping on board is a good push for his chances. Finds the right race today and can feature in the finish. MAGIC CARATS (1) won well on resumption over 1000m and steps straight out to the mile now. Form last campaign stacks up out to this distance and he rates highly on the fresh win. Can go on with the job. SWISHGOBANGO (2) broke his maiden last start over 1600m at this track, scoring by a head. Must be respected now that the penny has dropped. DASHING DIVA (4) raced on the pace last start before fading to finish seventh, beaten 8 lengths, over 1400m at this track. Among the chances. DANEA ROCK (3) was better last start and is worth including on the back of that effort.",
